## 📌 Quick Recap (Cheat Sheet)

- **EC2** = Virtual server on cloud (Instance, AMI, EBS, Security Group, Key Pair, Elastic IP, User Data)
- **Pricing** = On-Demand > Reserved > Spot > Savings Plan > Dedicated Host (flexibility ते cost-saving नुसार क्रम)
- **Networking** = VPC → Subnet (Public/Private) → EC2 + SG + ENI + EIP
- **Auto Scaling** = ALB + ASG मिळून high availability आणि automatic capacity management देतात
- **RDS Blue/Green** = Blue (live) + Green (copy) → test on Green → switchover → old Blue becomes rollback safety net

